% Noun phrases without an overt head noun whose referent is a subset of the
% entities given by an of-PP (some of the dogs) introduce the 'part_of'
% relation between subset and set.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Partitives/):
%   part_of[ARG0 x1, ARG1 x2]

pattern { P [pred="part_of"]; P -[1=ARG1]-> X }
